# Build your own Claude Code — agent notes

## Project type

Codecrafters **course definition** repo. Learner code lives on CodeCrafters; this tree has starters, stage copy, and partial solutions.

## Full tools + skills locally

- Preferred reference (Apple Silicon): `playground/rust/` (Read, Write, Bash, Skill, agent loop, skills extension)
- Python parity: `playground/python/`
- Run: `cd playground/rust && ./your_program.sh -p "..."` (loads `playground/.env` → Ollama at ollama.tokenizin.com / localhost)
- Skills: `.claude/skills/` at repo root (walk-up discovery from playground cwd)

## Specs before code changes

Read `stage_descriptions/` and `course-definition.yml` before changing behavior. Skills extension details: `extension_designs/skills.md`.

## Cursor / Claude Code in this repo

- `.claude/settings.json` — permissive tool allow list for local work
- `.claude/skills/course-map` — navigation skill for this repository

## Debugging loops

If the same fix fails repeatedly: web search + ask the user (HITL), then append a short TLDR of the **working** fix here under Past fixes.

### Past fixes

- **P2 NomadWorks fork args:** Agent `.md` bodies rarely include `$ARGUMENTS`. Slash `/pma …` must append `User request:` when no placeholders, or the fork only sees role text. Shared helper: `fork_user_body` (Rust + Python).
- **ollama.tokenizin.com 403:** Not CF Access/WAF — Ollama rejects `Host: ollama.tokenizin.com`. Fix: tunnel `originRequest.httpHostHeader: 127.0.0.1:11434` in `starworld/scripts/sync-tunnel-ingress.sh` (then sync). Local reproduce: `curl -H 'Host: ollama.tokenizin.com' http://127.0.0.1:11434/` → 403.
- **P3 NomadWorks tools:** OpenCode plugin tools need session/client; playground shims validate (phase0/strict), file discussions, and sync `nomadflow_run_workflow` via `workflow_runner` fork. `nomadflow_prompt_workflow` cannot drive background sessions.
